{
  "name": "sun-panel",
  "display_name": "Sun-Panel",
  "description": "Sun-Panel 是一个服务器、NAS 导航面板、Homepage、浏览器首页，界面简洁、资源占用低，支持内外网模式一键切换，并附带简易 Docker 管理功能。",
  "category": "tool",
  "tags": ["工具", "导航", "导航页", "面板", "Homepage"],
  "website": "https://doc.sun-panel.top/zh_cn/",
  "source_url": "https://github.com/hslr-s/sun-panel",
  "architectures": ["amd64", "arm64"],
  "image": "hslr/sun-panel",
  "default_ports": [
    {"port": 3002, "protocol": "tcp", "description": "Web 界面"}
  ],
  "config_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "required": ["ports", "volumes", "sun_panel_env", "privileged"],
    "containers": [
      {
        "name": "sun-panel",
        "title": "Sun-Panel",
        "settings": [
          {"type": "ports", "title": "端口设置", "fields": ["ports"]},
          {"type": "volumes", "title": "存储空间设置", "fields": ["volumes"]},
          {"type": "env", "title": "环境变量", "fields": ["sun_panel_env"]},
          {"type": "advanced", "title": "高级设置", "fields": ["privileged"]}
        ],
        "description": "Sun-Panel 导航面板"
      }
    ],
    "properties": {
      "ports": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["local_port", "container_port", "protocol"],
          "properties": {
            "protocol": {"enum": ["tcp", "udp"], "type": "string", "title": "协议", "default": "tcp"},
            "local_port": {"type": "integer", "title": "本地端口", "maximum": 65535, "minimum": 1},
            "container_port": {"type": "integer", "title": "容器端口", "maximum": 65535, "minimum": 1}
          }
        },
        "title": "端口设置",
        "default": [
          {"protocol": "tcp", "local_port": 3002, "container_port": 3002}
        ]
      },
      "volumes": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["host_path", "container_path", "mode"],
          "properties": {
            "mode": {"enum": ["rw", "ro"], "type": "string", "title": "权限", "default": "rw"},
            "host_path": {"type": "string", "title": "本地路径", "format": "directory"},
            "container_path": {"type": "string", "title": "容器路径"}
          }
        },
        "title": "存储空间设置",
        "default": [
          {"mode": "rw", "host_path": "sun-panel/conf", "container_path": "/app/conf"},
          {"mode": "rw", "host_path": "sun-panel/uploads", "container_path": "/app/uploads"},
          {"mode": "rw", "host_path": "sun-panel/database", "container_path": "/app/database"}
        ]
      },
      "privileged": {
        "type": "boolean",
        "title": "特权模式",
        "default": false,
        "description": "一般情况下无需开启"
      },
      "sun_panel_env": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["key", "value"],
          "properties": {
            "key": {"type": "string", "title": "变量名"},
            "value": {"type": "string", "title": "值"}
          }
        },
        "title": "环境变量",
        "default": [
          {"key": "TZ", "value": "Asia/Shanghai"}
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "yaml_template": "services:\n  sun-panel:\n    image: {{ image }}\n    container_name: {{ project_name }}\n    ports:\n{%- for port in ports %}\n      - \"{{ port.local_port }}:{{ port.container_port }}/{{ port.protocol }}\"\n{%- endfor %}\n    volumes:\n{%- for vol in volumes %}\n      - {{ to_host_path(vol.host_path if (vol.host_path.startswith('/') or vol.shared) else project_name ~ '/' ~ vol.host_path) }}:{{ vol.container_path }}:{{ vol.mode }}\n{%- endfor %}\n    privileged: {{ privileged | lower }}\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    environment:\n{%- for item in sun_panel_env %}\n      - {{ item.key }}={{ item.value }}\n{%- endfor %}\n",
  "readme": "# Sun-Panel\n\nSun-Panel 是一个服务器、NAS 导航面板、Homepage、浏览器首页，界面简洁、功能强大、资源占用小，支持局域网与公网模式一键切换，并内置简易的 Docker 管理面板。\n\n## 部署前准备\n\n1. 在「存储空间设置」中确认配置（`/app/conf`）、上传文件（`/app/uploads`）和数据库（`/app/database`）的挂载路径。\n2. 默认 Web 端口为 `3002`，如与本机其他服务冲突可在「端口设置」中修改本地端口。\n\n## 部署后使用\n\n1. 访问 `http://<NAS-IP>:3002` 打开 Sun-Panel。\n2. 首次使用按页面提示注册管理员账号。\n3. 在设置中可切换内网/外网访问模式、自定义图标与样式。\n\n## 说明\n\n- 项目自 v1.3.0 后新增 PRO 功能并暂时闭源，免费功能对普通用户无影响。\n- 官方文档：https://doc.sun-panel.top/zh_cn/",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "type": "compose",
  "backup_paths": ["/app/conf", "/app/uploads", "/app/database"],
  "is_builtin": false
}
